&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare is looking for a bright, proactive, and detail-oriented Senior Administrative Assistant to support two leaders in our Developer GTM organization, the VP, Developer Revenue &amp;amp; VP, Growth. We are looking for a dynamic and dedicated candidate who is comfortable with multi-tasking and prioritization in a fast-speed environment with close attention to detail, accuracy, and timeliness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a seasoned, experienced professional, you will work on problems of diverse scope, demonstrate good judgment in selecting methods, and network effectively with senior personnel across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calendar &amp;amp; Conflict Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively manage complex calendars with a strong understanding of business priorities. Independently resolve most scheduling conflicts and anticipate meeting requests and logistical needs before they are explicitly stated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently manage and coordinate complex international and domestic travel, including visa and passport needs, as well as end-to-end logistical arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Support &amp;amp; Business Context:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a deeper understanding of the managers&#39; roles and the broader business context. Serve as a trusted gatekeeper who can confidently answer routine questions on behalf of the executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expense &amp;amp; Meeting Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare and manage expense reports, and coordinate both internal and external meeting needs with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projects &amp;amp; Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Contributes significantly to ad-hoc/special projects. Recognize where operational processes can be improved and actively suggest and implement those process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate and assist with event planning as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an informal mentor to junior admins and begin to influence and improve team-wide processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+&lt;/strong&gt; of experience as an Administrative Assistant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; A seasoned professional with proven experience handling problems of diverse scope and demonstrating excellent judgment in selecting administrative and operational methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactiveness &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong sense of urgency, proactiveness, and the ability to manage your own time with limited or no supervision—hitting the ground running to take charge of the position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong written and verbal communication skills; ability to network and build strong relationships with senior personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional organizational skills and an elite attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;no task is too small&quot; attitude combined with the strategic mindset needed to anticipate executive needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
