&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Experience building scalable, reliable, and observable data pipelines, with an understanding of performance, data quality, and operational best practices.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
