ears direct experience selling network security or SaaS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct experience selling to enterprise accounts acting as lead seller and relationship owner&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct experience from established global technology vendors&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical background in engineering, computer science, or MIS a plus&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of computer networking and “how the internet works”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and interpersonal communication skills (verbal and written) as well as organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
