&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Available Locations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sweden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You aren&#39;t just selling a product; you’re selling the security, performance, and reliability that major enterprises require to stay competitive. You will be a foundational part of our growth story in the region, bridging the gap between complex technical challenges and the business value that keeps our customers ahead of the curve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why You’ll Love This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;builder’s role.&lt;/strong&gt; We’re looking for a hunter who thrives on identifying opportunities, crafting a narrative, and navigating the nuances of enterprise sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be an architect of growth:&lt;/strong&gt; You will own your territory, build a strategy from the ground up, and nurture long-term, high-impact relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a technical bridge:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work alongside our solution engineers to demystify complex network architecture for stakeholders ranging from junior developers to the C-suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll work at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll be supported by a world-class team, all while maintaining the agility of a lean, remote-first operation in Sweden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and execute a comprehensive territory plan. You aren&#39;t just hitting a quota; you’re building a lasting market presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Hunt&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, qualify, and capture new Enterprise business across the Nordics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Narrative:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate Cloudflare’s powerful technical capabilities into compelling value propositions that solve real-world problems for your clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead contract negotiations and manage the full cycle of the sales process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop long-term, strategic relationships. Our customers stay because we solve their hardest problems—and you’ll be at the center of that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seasoned Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of direct B2B experience selling into Enterprise/Large-scale organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong, established network within the Swedish market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional-level proficiency in both &lt;strong&gt;Swedish and English (Norwegian is a plus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of Cloud, Security, and how the internet actually functions. You don&#39;t need to write code, but you need to speak the language of engineering and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Builder&quot; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are self-motivated, entrepreneurial, and thrive in dynamic, fast-paced environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to tailor your message, whether you&#39;re talking to a CTO or a procurement lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Does this sound like your next challenge?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re looking for someone who wants to leave a mark on the Nordic market while helping to build a safer, faster internet for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help us build a better Internet.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloudflare isn’t just another tech company; we are the infrastructure that keeps the Internet fast, safe, and reliable for millions of users worldwide. We provide the &quot;plumbing&quot; for the modern digital economy, and we’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;entrepreneurial Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to help us own the Nordic market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Sweden based hires: Estimated annual salary is between SEK 1,586,000 - SEK 2,180,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is eligible to earn incentive compensation under Cloudflare’s Sales Compensation Plan. The estimated annual salary range includes the on-target incentive compensation that may be attained in this role under the Sales Compensation Plan.&lt;/p&gt;
