&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in equity compensation administration for any U.S.-listed public company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
